nation online  monetary donation at vegasrescue.org and  that's also where they can find all the  information about the event  perfect well thank you so much valerie  for your service for the las vegas  rescue mission service and happy  holidays  thanks you too we want to thank nevada  state bank for sponsoring this segment  and being one of our community pride  partners
 

